s $R$ and $D$ (they have been swapped).\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, the rectangle $R$ covers the region $D$ completely.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-86867/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "100ab73e-3dad-5b15-9da2-d244c67bcc9b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-86867"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-80566/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "aed8824a-9d2b-5f4b-b0c7-e408c7aef1f5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80566/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "af54e9bb-7e45-56b8-bd65-32ad74d3ee05" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80566/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "6e17ad15-193e-543f-9dfb-3a2d65ef1c7f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80566/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "7433f8ae-ee4d-5d84-af1b-23312a4f1801" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80566/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "67361ac1-5984-59ae-a801-e8f3b697b3c2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80566/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2e09ac83-a1f1-5415-9362-4d9556eb82a9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-80566/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer-field/choices ["q-80566/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d